```{=html}
<div class="team-grid">
<% for (const item of items) { %>
  <div class="team-card" <%= metadataAttrs(item) %>>
    <img class="team-photo" alt="Photo of <%= item.title %>"
         src="<%= item.image ? item.image : '../assets/images/team/blank_avatar.jpg' %>">
    <div class="team-body">
      <div class="team-name"><%= item.title %></div>
      <div class="team-role"><%= item.role %><% if (item.institution) { %> · <%= item.institution %><% } %></div>
      <% if (item.description) { %><p class="team-bio"><%= item.description %></p><% } %>
    </div>
  </div>
<% } %>
</div>
```
